+# Mobile Screens Mock Data Cleanup

+## Status: ⚠️ 26 screens identified

+## Process for Each Screen

+1. **Identify mock data**:
+   ```bash
+   grep -n "mockData\|sampleData\|placeholder\|fake" <screen>.tsx
+   ```
+
+2. **Replace with API calls**:
+   ```typescript
+   // ❌ BEFORE
+   const [data, setData] = useState(MOCK_DATA);
+
+   // ✅ AFTER
+   const [data, setData] = useState([]);
+   const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);
+
+   useEffect(() => {
+     api.getPlayers().then(res => {
+       setData(res.data);
+       setLoading(false);
+     });
+   }, []);
+   ```
+
+3. **Add error handling**:
+   ```typescript
+   catch (error) {
+     Alert.alert('Error', 'Failed to load data');
+     setLoading(false);
+   }
+   ```
+
+4. **Test with backend**:
+   - Start Metro: `npx expo start`
+   - Verify API calls in logs
+   - No "Using mockData" warnings
+
+## Priority HIGH Screens (Complete first)
+
+### 1. LoginScreen.tsx
+**Mock pattern**: Placeholder credentials
+**API**: `api.login({ email, password })`
+**Test**: Login with scout1@arcane.com / <DEMO_PASSWORD>
+
+### 2. ArcaneIndexScreen.tsx
+**Mock pattern**: Fake AI scores
+**API**: `api.getArkaneIndex(playerId)`
+**Test**: Verify real player scores displayed
+
+### 3. MatchesScreen.tsx
+**Mock pattern**: Sample match list
+**API**: `api.getMatches({ status: 'SCHEDULED' })`
+**Test**: Verify real matches from DB
+
+### 4. ReportsScreen.tsx
+**Mock pattern**: Hardcoded reports array
+**API**: `api.getReports({ limit: 20 })`
+**Test**: Create report, verify it appears
+
+### 5. MarketplaceScreen.tsx
+**Mock pattern**: Fake scout listings
+**API**: `api.getMarket({ limit: 20 })`
+**Test**: Verify real marketplace data
+
+## Priority MEDIUM Screens
+
+### 6-7. Gamification (BadgesScreen, AchievementsScreen)
+**Mock pattern**: Sample badges/achievements
+**API**: Check if gamification endpoints exist
+**Action**: May need backend endpoints first
+
+### 8-11. Kanban Components
+**Mock pattern**: Placeholder forms
+**API**:
+- `api.createBoard()`
+- `api.createColumn()`
+- `api.createCard()`
+**Test**: Create board → column → card flow
+
+### 12-16. AI Screens
+**Mock pattern**: Various AI mock responses
+**API**:
+- `api.chatWithArkaneGPT()`
+- `api.getMarketValue()`
+- SmartScout features
+**Test**: Each AI feature with real backend
+
+## Priority LOW Screens
+
+### 17-26. Remaining Screens
+**Pattern**: Minor mocks (contact forms, signup placeholders)
+**Action**: Clean after high-priority screens work
+
+---
+
+## Cleanup Script (Automated)
+
+```bash
+#!/bin/bash
+# cleanup-mobile-mocks.sh
+
+SCREENS=(
+  "screens/auth/LoginScreen.tsx"
+  "screens/ai/ArcaneIndexScreen.tsx"
+  "screens/matches/MatchesScreen.tsx"
+  "screens/reports/ReportsScreen.tsx"
+  "screens/marketplace/MarketplaceScreen.tsx"
+)
+
+for screen in "${SCREENS[@]}"; do
+  echo "Processing: $screen"
+
+  # 1. Find mock patterns
+  grep -n "const.*=.*\[\s*{.*}" "mobile/src/$screen" > "/tmp/${screen##*/}.mocks"
+
+  # 2. Suggest API replacement
+  echo "  → Replace with api.getX() call"
+
+  # 3. Add to cleanup list
+  echo "$screen" >> mobile/CLEANED_SCREENS.txt
+done
+
+echo "✅ Cleanup complete"
+```
+
+## Testing Checklist
+
+After each screen cleanup:
+
+- [ ] No "mockData" console warnings
+- [ ] API call visible in Metro logs
+- [ ] Loading state shows correctly
+- [ ] Error handling works (test with backend down)
+- [ ] Data displays correctly
+- [ ] No TypeScript errors
+- [ ] Jest tests pass
+
+## Estimated Time
+
+- HIGH priority (5 screens): **1-2 hours**
+- MEDIUM priority (11 screens): **2-3 hours**
+- LOW priority (10 screens): **1 hour**
+
+**Total**: 4-6 hours for complete Mobile cleanup
+
+## After Cleanup
+
+Run full test suite:
+```bash
+npm test -- --coverage
+# Expected: All tests pass, no mocks in coverage
+```
